    [Feature][MRV2][Spec Decode] Support draft model (#19364)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Support draft model spec decode in MRV2, followed
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43091, adapted by me.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    N/A
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    ```
    python examples/test_draft_model_acceptance.py \
    --model-dir ~/.cache/modelscope/hub/models/Qwen/Qwen3-8B \
    --draft-model ~/.cache/modelscope/hub/models/Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B \
    --num-spec-tokens 3 \
    --dataset-name hf \
    --dataset-path philschmid/mt-bench \
    --num-prompts 400 \
    --temp 0 \
    --output-len 256 \
    --max-model-len 10000 \
    --enforce-eager
    ```
    
